<title>USA: Milwaukie, Ore., yields 5.60 pct in 2010.</title>
<headline>Milwaukie, Ore., yields 5.60 pct in 2010.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it tentatively priced $1.235 million of Milwaukie, Ore., water revenue and refunding bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2010.</p>
